OL,3,AApu returns to The Simpsons with new
OL,4,Avoice after race row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Simpsons character Apu has returned
OL,7,Fto the show voiced by a new actor,
OL,8,Fafter almost a decade away amid
OL,9,Faccusations of racial stereotypes.
OL,11,FApu Nahasapeemapetilon - to give the
OL,12,Fmuch-loved shopkeeper his full name -
OL,13,Fre-appeared in Sunday's episode on US
OL,14,Fnetwork Fox, titled The Revengening,
OL,15,Fbut now voiced by India-born, US-raised
OL,16,Factor Sunil Malhotra.
OL,18,FThe character has been seen but not
OL,19,Fheard around Springfield since the
OL,20,FOctober 2017 episode The Serfsons, and
OL,21,Fhis big return to action had reportedly
OL,22,Fbeen a closely guarded secret.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,171,160,200,105,0,100
